@title Cabinet: drill cue visible after Centre rails on devices (run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=1)
@area Cabinet
# The drill cue (a ring closing on each new hole) runs in the live app. The harness and Reduce motion show the plain plate, so pictures are stable; scenario 302 is run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=1 and takes its picture a frame after the rails moved and their screw holes are new (fixture with rails off the middle of their devices).
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot before
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text rails and ducts
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Centre rails on devices"
wait 1
shot after
check_layout
